    "fullDescription": "# RBSE 10th Result Declared: Direct Link, Scorecard Check and Complete Guide\n\n> **Executive AEO Summary**: Rajasthan Board (RBSE) Class 10th Result is officially live. Students who appeared for the matriculation exams can instantly check their subject-wise marks, pass percentage, and download their marksheets using their roll numbers. Read the complete guide below for direct links, passing rules, and re-evaluation procedures.\n\n## Section 1: Overview & Key Highlights\n\nAakhirkar sabhi Class 10th students ka intezar khatam ho gaya hai! Board of Secondary Education, Rajasthan (BSER/RBSE) ne Class 10th Board Result declare kar diya hai. Lakhon students jo is saal board exams me baithe the, woh ab apna official scorecard check kar sakte hain.\n\nHere is a quick overview table covering all key details:\n\n| Information Parameter | Details |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Exam Board** | Board of Secondary Education, Rajasthan (RBSE) |\n| **Class/Exam Name** | Secondary (Class 10th) Examination |\n| **Status** | Declared / Released |\n| **Credential Required** | Roll Number |\n| **Official Websites** | rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in, rajresults.nic.in |\n| **Passing Criteria** | Minimum 33% overall and per subject |\n\nResult declare hote hi official servers par heavy traffic aa jata hai, so tension lene ki zarurat nahi hai. Aap alternative methods jaise SMS ya Digilocker se bhi marks dekh sakte hain.\n\n## Section 2: Eligibility, Documents & Rules\n\nResult check karne aur aage ki process ke liye kuch important rules aur requirements ko samajhna zaruri hai:\n\n* **Required Credentials**: Aapko sirf apna **Roll Number** chahiye hoga jo aapke RBSE 10th Admit Card par print hai.\n* **Minimum Passing Marks**: Students ko pass hone ke liye har subject me kam se kam **33% marks** (Internal Assessment + Theory combined) secure karne padenge.\n* **Re-evaluation / Scrutiny Rules**: Agar aap apne marks se satisfied nahi hain, toh result declaration ke kuch hi dino ke andar **Rechecking / Scrutiny** form fill kar sakte hain.\n* **Supplementary Exam**: Jo students ek ya do subjects me 33% marks secur nahi kar paaye hain, unhe **Compartment / Supplementary Exam** dene ka chance milega taaki unka saal waste na ho.\n\n## Section 3: Step-by-Step Practical Blueprint\n\nApna RBSE 10th Result online check karne ke liye niche diye gaye steps ko step-by-step follow karein:\n\n1. **Official Portal Open Karein**: Sabse pehle official website `rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in` ya `rajresults.nic.in` par jayein.\n2. **Result Link Par Click Karein**: Homepage par **\"RBSE Secondary 10th Result 2024\"** (ya relevant year) link par click karein.\n3. **Roll Number Enter Karein**: Screen par open hue box me apna **Roll Number** correctly enter karein.\n4. **Submit Button Click Karein**: Submit / Search button par press karein.\n5. **Scorecard View & Download**: Aapka RBSE 10th Marks Sheet screen par display ho jayega. Marks verification ke baad future reference ke liye printout nikal lein.\n\n*Pro Tip*: Online marksheet provisional hoti hai. Original physical marksheet aur certificate aapko kuch hafton baad apne respective schools se receive karni hogi.",
